Package: usb4-rdma-provider
Version: @VERSION@
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libibverbs1
Maintainer: AppMana <ops@appmana.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/AppMana/forks-thunderbolt-ibverbs
Description: ALPHA usb4_rdma and tbrxe libibverbs userspace providers
 Drop-in libibverbs providers that let libibverbs enumerate and use
 thunderbolt_ibverbs kernel devices: usb4_rdma for the legacy engine and
 tbrxe for the rxe-derived engine (rxe uverbs ABI under the private USB4
 driver id, coexisting with the distro's librxe). Install alongside the
 matching thunderbolt-ibverbs-dkms package for full ibv_devices visibility
 and downstream RDMA tool support (NCCL, vllm, perftest). This AppMana
 build is alpha/pre-release software.
